    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApproximately 85 acres of mixed quality agricultural land, well located in the areas of Roe and Gortaroe, off the Westport to Newport Road with an option to buy a detached cottage at an additional cost. \n\nThe cottage is in need of refurbishment and modernisation throughout but offers great potential for a wide range of buyers. We believe the property should qualify for the Vacant Homes Refurbishment Grant.\n\nWith a floor area of approximately 73.3 sq m/789 sq ft, accommodation comprises of entrance porch, spacious living room, kitchen, utility room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nThe property is contained in a number of parcels, parts of Folios MY7026 and MY49797 with good access from a number of points on the road. The land is of fair quality, hilly in parts, and would be suitable for animal grazing. A slatted shed and barn are located on one of the parcels. \n\nDirect payments from the Eco Agri Scheme are available. \n\nOFFERS IN EXCESS OF 575,000"
      },
      {
